    "Id": "vehicledef_DRILLSON_C",
    "Name": "Drillson (C)",
    "Details": "Developed by Clan Jade Falcon when they captured the world of Skye, this version of the Drillson was produced with factories retooled to utilise Clan laser technology. Both the C2 and the C are common sights across Jade Falcon garrison clusters. The C mounts a LRM 10 with an Artemis V, a single Large Chemical Laser, twin Machine Guns, and four ER Small Lasers. It carries two tons of LRM ammunition, two tons of Chemical Laser ammunition, and a half-ton of MG ammunition in CASE protected bins.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       125     25\n<b>Left</b>         110     25\n<b>Right</b>       110     25\n<b>Rear</b>        105     25\n<b>Turret</b>      125     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      575    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Laser</color>",
    "Icon": "Drillson"
  },
